flowchart TB
  accTitle: One agent decision loop
  accDescr: Frozen agent identity, visible game facts, personally heard dialogue, private memory, and current stakes form a bounded context. The model returns a typed proposal. Deterministic phase validation accepts, repairs, rejects, or falls back. Accepted choices become canonical facts while every call can produce separate evidence for later reflection.

  subgraph decisionCall["BOUNDED DECISION CALL"]
    direction LR
    Inputs["Identity, facts, heard dialogue, memory, and stakes"]
    Inputs --> Context["Phase-scoped context"]
    Context --> Model["LLM call"]
    Model --> Proposal["Typed proposal"]
  end
  Proposal --> Validate{"Deterministic phase validation"}

  Validate -->|accepted unchanged| Event["Canonical event"]
  Validate -->|repair, rejection, or fallback| Provenance["Labeled provenance; no false exact link"]

  Model --> Evidence["Thinking, cognition, and private trace evidence"]
  Event -. exact decision receipt when eligible .-> Evidence
  Event --> Outcome["Revealed outcome"]
  Outcome --> Reflect["Strategic reflection"]
  Evidence --> Reflect
  Reflect -. updates next context .-> Inputs

  class Inputs inputNode
  class Context,Model,Proposal runtimeNode
  class Validate gateNode
  class Event,Outcome truthNode
  class Provenance,Evidence evidenceNode
  class Reflect cognitionNode

  classDef inputNode fill:#172554,stroke:#60a5fa,color:#eff6ff,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef runtimeNode fill:#3b0764,stroke:#c084fc,color:#faf5ff,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef gateNode fill:#4c1d95,stroke:#e9d5ff,color:#faf5ff,stroke-width:2px
  classDef truthNode fill:#052e16,stroke:#4ade80,color:#f0fdf4,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef evidenceNode fill:#431407,stroke:#fb923c,color:#fff7ed,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef cognitionNode fill:#3f2b08,stroke:#facc15,color:#fefce8,stroke-width:1.5px
  style decisionCall fill:transparent,stroke:#334155,stroke-width:1px
